ified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityValue(_:)-6at9p":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityValue(_:)-6at9p","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityValue"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","text":"Text"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","text":"ModifiedContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityvalue(_:)-6at9p","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","title":"accessibilityValue(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reproduces the layer hierarchy measured from Origami’s runner render: a full-screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The card maps the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. If its touch-up position is within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"100 points of center on both axes, the placed graph’s Reset branch pulses Drag’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Reset input and returns the card to its origin."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"symbol"}}}